Security Headers

You're missing a proper Content Security Policy (CSP).

For a production ecommerce site, I strongly recommend using django-csp and defining a restrictive policy that
allows only the origins you need (your own domain, Cloudinary, payment providers, fonts, etc.). This 
significantly reduces the impact of XSS attacks.



essential before launch:

Structured logging (LOGGING configuration)
Error monitoring (Sentry or similar)
Content Security Policy (CSP) using django-csp